K.6 cross-platform matrix (4 jobs):
  linux-x86_64 + linux-aarch64 (QEMU) + macos-15-intel + macos-14 arm64;
  each runs `cargo test --workspace --release`. (LGTM round 3)

K.7 criterion benches (5 hot paths):
