- [coverage.yml]($REPO_ROOT/.github/workflows/coverage.yml:32): baseline lookup uses `gh run list/download`, but job permissions omit `actions: read`; with explicit permissions, unspecified scopes are `none`, so delta will fall back to `n/a`. Add `actions: read`. Source: https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/workflow-syntax#permissions
